  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ちていの　がんえんそうで　うまれた。きちょうな　しおを　わけてくれるためむかしは　とくに　だいじにされた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "땅속의 암염층에서 태어났다. 귀한 소금을 나눠 주기 때문에 옛날에는 특히 더 귀하게 여겨졌다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "出生在地底的岩鹽層。會願意分享貴重的鹽巴，因此在過去更是受到重視。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon est né dans des couches souterraines de sel gemme. Connu pour partager son précieux sel, il était très apprécié autrefois.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es entstand in unterirdischen Salzschichten. Da es kostbares Salz mit den Menschen teilt, wurde es früher ganz besonders geschätzt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Surgen de estratos salinos subterráneos. Antaño se los tenía en alta estima, pues compartían su sal, un mineral por entonces muy preciado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È nato nei giacimenti sotterranei di salgemma. In passato era tenuto in grande considerazione poiché condivideva il suo prezioso sale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It was born in a layer of rock salt deep under the earth. This species was particularly treasured in the old days, as they would share precious salt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "地底の　岩塩層で　生まれた。貴重な　塩を　分けてくれるため昔は　とくに　大事にされた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "出生在地底的岩盐层。原意分享贵重的盐巴，因此在过去非常受到重视。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Surgen de estratos salinos subterráneos. Antaño se los tenía en alta estima, pues compartían su sal, un mineral por entonces muy preciado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あるくと　じめんで　からだが　けずれしおを　のこす。　たいないで　しおがつねに　つくられて　ほじゅうされる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "걸으면 땅바닥에 의해 몸이 깎여 소금을 남긴다. 항상 체내에서 소금을 만들고 있기 때문에 금방 보충된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "身體會受到地面磨損，因此凡走過必留下鹽跡。鹽隨時都會在體內被製造出來補充。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son corps s’effrite au contact du sol et laisse du sel dans son sillage, mais comme son organisme en produit constamment, il se régénère sans mal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit jedem Schritt schabt sein Körper am Boden und hinterlässt dabei Salz. Sein Körper stellt jedoch kontinuierlich neues Salz her.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Arrastra el cuerpo por el suelo al desplazarse, por lo que deja un rastro de sal. La fabrica y repone continuamente en su interior.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Muovendosi struscia contro il terreno, lasciando una scia di sale. Produce continuamente sale nel corpo per sostituire quello che perde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The ground scrapes its body as it travels, causing it to leave salt behind. Salt is constantly being created and replenished inside Nacli’s body.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "歩くと　地面で　体が　削れ塩を　残す。　体内で　塩がつねに　作られて　補充される。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "身体会受到地面磨损，因此只要走过就会留下盐迹。体内会随时制造出盐来补充。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Arrastra el cuerpo por el suelo al desplazarse, por lo que deja un rastro de sal. La fabrica y repone continuamente en su interior.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
